<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ar" dir="rtl">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>FX9 Dashboard — لوحة تحكم البوت</title>
  <meta name="description" content="FX9 Dashboard — لوحة تحكم متقدمة لإدارة بوت FX9 على ديسكورد">
  <meta property="og:title" content="FX9 Dashboard — لوحة تحكم البوت" />
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#6366f1" />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cairo:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/css/all.min.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
  <link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml">
  <style>
:root {
  --fb: #06060e;
  --fc: #0c0c1a;
  --fbo: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
  --ft: rgba(255,255,255,0.87);
  --fm: rgba(255,255,255,0.28);
  --fp: #6366f1;
  --fb2: #3b82f6;
  --fp2: #8b5cf6;
  --fa: #a78bfa;
  --fg: rgba(99,102,241,0.18);
}
* { margin:0; padding:0; box-sizing:border-box; }
body { font-family:'Cairo',sans-serif; background:var(--fb); color:var(--ft); overflow-x:hidden; }
a { text-decoration:none; color:inherit; }

.f-nav {
  position:fixed; top:0; left:0; right:0; z-index:1000;
  display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between;
  padding:0 28px; height:64px;
  background:rgba(6,6,14,0.7); backdrop-filter:blur(20px) saturate(1.4);
  border-bottom:1px solid var(--fbo);
}
.f-brand { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:9px; font-size:1.05rem; font-weight:800; color:white; }
.f-brand-badge {
  width:28px; height:28px; border-radius:6px;
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--fp),var(--fp2));
  display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size:0.75rem; color:white;
  box-shadow:0 0 14px var(--fg);
}
.f-nbtn {
  display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:7px; cursor:pointer;
  padding:7px 18px; border-radius:8px; font-family:'Cairo',sans-serif;
  font-size:0.82rem; font-weight:600; transition:all 0.25s; border:none;
}
.f-nbtn-p { background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--fp),var(--fp2)); color:white; box-shadow:0 3px 14px var(--fg); }
.f-nbtn-p:hover { transform:translateY(-1px); box-shadow:0 5px 22px var(--fg); }
.f-nbtn-g { background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04); color:var(--fm); border:1px solid var(--fbo); }
.f-nbtn-g:hover { background:rgba(255,255,255,0.07); color:white; }
.f-nbtn-d { background:rgba(237,66,69,0.12); color:#f87171; border:1px solid rgba(237,66,69,0.15); }

.f-hero {
  position:relative; min-height:100vh; display:flex; align-items:center;
  background:linear-gradient(180deg, #06060e 0%, #0a0a1e 40%, #06060e 100%);
  overflow:hidden;
}
.f-hero-bg {
  position:absolute; inset:0;
  background:
    radial-gradient(ellipse 60% 45% at 25% 0%, rgba(99,102,241,0.08) 0%, transparent 60%),
    radial-gradient(ellipse 50% 40% at 75% 100%, rgba(139,92,246,0.06) 0%, transparent 55%);
}
.f-grid {
  position:absolute; inset:0; opacity:0.25;
  background-image:linear-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,0.03) 1px,transparent 1px),linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.03) 1px,transparent 1px);
  background-size:52px 52px;
}
.f-orb {
  position:absolute; border-radius:50%; filter:blur(130px);
  animation:fDrift 16s ease-in-out infinite;
}
.f-o1 { width:500px; height:500px; background:var(--fp); top:-150px; left:10%; opacity:0.08; }
.f-o2 { width:380px; height:380px; background:var(--fp2); bottom:-120px; right:15%; opacity:0.06; animation-delay:-8s; }
@keyframes fDrift {
  0%,100% { transform:translate(0,0) scale(1); }
  50% { transform:translate(30px,-35px) scale(1.1); }
}
.f-hero-inner {
  position:relative; z-index:1; max-width:1150px; margin:0 auto; padding:120px 28px 80px;
  display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:50px; align-items:center;
}
@media (max-width:900px) { .f-hero-inner { grid-template-columns:1fr; text-align:center; gap:50px; } }
.f-left { max-width:500px; }
@media (max-width:900px) { .f-left { margin:0 auto; } }
.f-pill {
  display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:6px;
  background:rgba(99,102,241,0.06); border:1px solid rgba(99,102,241,0.1);
  padding:4px 14px; border-radius:100px; font-size:0.72rem; font-weight:500;
  color:var(--fa); margin-bottom:18px;
}
.f-pill i { font-size:0.45rem; color:#57f287; }
.f-left h1 { font-size:2.8rem; font-weight:800; line-height:1.2; margin-bottom:14px; }
.f-left h1 em { font-style:normal; background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--fp),var(--fp2),var(--fa)); -webkit-background-clip:text; -webkit-text-fill-color:transparent; background-clip:text; }
.f-left p { font-size:0.95rem; color:var(--fm); line-height:1.8; margin-bottom:26px; }
.f-acts { display:flex; gap:10px; }
@media (max-width:900px) { .f-acts { justify-content:center; } }
.f-btn {
  display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:7px;
  padding:11px 28px; border-radius:10px; font-family:'Cairo',sans-serif;
  font-size:0.9rem; font-weight:600; cursor:pointer; transition:all 0.3s; border:none;
}
.f-btn-p { background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--fp),var(--fp2)); color:white; box-shadow:0 4px 22px var(--fg); }
.f-btn-p:hover { transform:translateY(-2px); box-shadow:0 8px 36px var(--fg); color:white; }
.f-btn-s { background:transparent; color:var(--fm); border:1px solid var(--fbo); }
.f-btn-s:hover { border-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.12); color:white; }

.f-right { display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; }
@media (max-width:900px) { .f-right { display:none; } }
.f-frame {
  width:100%; max-width:440px;
  background:rgba(12,12,26,0.7); backdrop-filter:blur(24px);
  border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
  border-radius:14px; overflow:hidden;
  box-shadow:0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
}
.f-frame-h {
  display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px; padding:14px 18px;
  background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02); border-bottom:1px solid var(--fbo);
}
.f-frame-dots { display:flex; gap:5px; }
.f-frame-dot { width:8px; height:8px; border-radius:50%; }
.f-frame-dot:nth-child(1) { background:#ed4245; }
.f-frame-dot:nth-child(2) { background:#fbbf24; }
.f-frame-dot:nth-child(3) { background:#57f287; }
.f-frame-title { font-size:0.72rem; color:var(--fm); flex:1; text-align:center; }
.f-frame-b { padding:18px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:12px; }
.f-frame-row {
  display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px;
  padding:10px 12px; border-radius:8px;
  background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02); border:1px solid var(--fbo);
}
.f-frame-row:hover { background:rgba(99,102,241,0.04); border-color:rgba(99,102,241,0.08); }
.f-row-icon { width:30px; height:30px; border-radius:6px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size:0.7rem; flex-shrink:0; }
.f-row-info { flex:1; }
.f-row-title { font-size:0.75rem; font-weight:600; color:rgba(255,255,255,0.75); }
.f-row-sub { font-size:0.65rem; color:var(--fm); }
.f-row-val { font-size:0.75rem; font-weight:700; color:var(--fa); }

.f-band {
  padding:28px 24px;
  background:linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(99,102,241,0.03), rgba(139,92,246,0.03));
  border-top:1px solid var(--fbo); border-bottom:1px solid var(--fbo);
}
.f-band-inner {
  display:flex; justify-content:center; gap:80px; max-width:900px; margin:0 auto;
}
@media (max-width:600px) { .f-band-inner { flex-direction:column; gap:16px; align-items:center; } }
.f-band-item { display:flex; align-items:center; gap:14px; }
.f-band-num { font-size:1.5rem; font-weight:800; background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--fp),var(--fp2)); -webkit-background-clip:text; -webkit-text-fill-color:transparent; background-clip:text; }
.f-band-lbl { font-size:0.82rem; color:var(--fm); }

.f-sec { padding:90px 28px; }
.f-sec-inner { max-width:1100px; margin:0 auto; }
.f-label {
  display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:5px;
  padding:4px 12px; border-radius:20px; font-size:0.68rem; font-weight:600;
  margin-bottom:10px; letter-spacing:0.3px;
}
.f-label-p { background:rgba(99,102,241,0.06); border:1px solid rgba(99,102,241,0.08); color:var(--fa); }
.f-label-v { background:rgba(139,92,246,0.06); border:1px solid rgba(139,92,246,0.08); color:var(--fp2); }
.f-center { text-align:center; margin-bottom:55px; }
.f-center h2 { font-size:2rem; font-weight:800; margin-bottom:8px; }
.f-center h2 em { font-style:normal; background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--fp),var(--fp2)); -webkit-background-clip:text; -webkit-text-fill-color:transparent; background-clip:text; }
.f-center p { color:var(--fm); font-size:0.9rem; max-width:480px; margin:0 auto; line-height:1.8; }

.f-cards {
  display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr); gap:20px;
}
@media (max-width:1000px) { .f-cards { grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr); } }
@media (max-width:600px) { .f-cards { grid-template-columns:1fr; } }
.f-card {
  padding:22px 20px; border-radius:12px;
  background:var(--fc); border:1px solid var(--fbo);
  transition:all 0.35s ease; position:relative; overflow:hidden;
}
.f-card::after {
  content:''; position:absolute; bottom:0; left:20px; right:20px;
  height:1px; background:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent,var(--fp),var(--fp2),transparent);
  opacity:0; transition:opacity 0.35s;
}
.f-card:hover { transform:translateY(-3px); border-color:rgba(99,102,241,0.08); box-shadow:0 8px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.2); }
.f-card:hover::after { opacity:1; }
.f-cicon {
  width:36px; height:36px; border-radius:8px;
  display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
  margin-bottom:10px; font-size:0.85rem;
}
.f-card h3 { font-size:0.88rem; font-weight:700; margin-bottom:4px; }
.f-card p { font-size:0.76rem; color:var(--fm); line-height:1.7; }

.f-steps {
  display:flex; justify-content:center; gap:40px; max-width:900px; margin:0 auto;
  position:relative;
}
.f-steps::before {
  content:''; position:absolute; top:32px; left:calc(16.66% + 60px); right:calc(16.66% + 60px);
  height:1px; background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--fp),var(--fp2),var(--fp));
  opacity:0.15;
}
@media (max-width:800px) { .f-steps { flex-direction:column; gap:24px; align-items:center; } .f-steps::before { display:none; } }
.f-step { text-align:center; max-width:240px; position:relative; }
.f-step-num {
  width:36px; height:36px; border-radius:50%; margin:0 auto 12px;
  display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
  font-size:0.85rem; font-weight:800; color:white;
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--fp),var(--fp2));
  box-shadow:0 0 20px var(--fg); position:relative; z-index:1;
}
.f-step h4 { font-size:0.9rem; font-weight:700; margin-bottom:4px; }
.f-step p { font-size:0.76rem; color:var(--fm); line-height:1.7; }

.f-stats {
  display:flex; justify-content:center; gap:80px; max-width:800px; margin:0 auto;
}
@media (max-width:600px) { .f-stats { flex-direction:column; gap:20px; align-items:center; } }
.f-sitem { text-align:center; }
.f-sval {
  font-size:2rem; font-weight:800; display:block;
  background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--fp),var(--fp2));
  -webkit-background-clip:text; -webkit-text-fill-color:transparent; background-clip:text;
}
.f-slbl { font-size:0.8rem; color:var(--fm); margin-top:2px; }

.f-cta {
  max-width:600px; margin:0 auto; text-align:center;
  padding:48px 44px; border-radius:16px;
  background:linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(99,102,241,0.03), rgba(139,92,246,0.03));
  border:1px solid var(--fbo); position:relative; overflow:hidden;
}
.f-cta::before {
  content:''; position:absolute; top:0; left:0; right:0; height:1px;
  background:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent,var(--fp),var(--fp2),var(--fa),transparent);
  opacity:0.4;
}
.f-cta h2 { font-size:1.5rem; font-weight:800; margin-bottom:8px; }
.f-cta p { color:var(--fm); margin-bottom:22px; font-size:0.88rem; line-height:1.7; }

.f-footer {
  border-top:1px solid var(--fbo); padding:18px 28px;
}
.f-footer-inner {
  display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center;
  max-width:1100px; margin:0 auto; font-size:0.74rem; color:var(--fm);
}
.f-fsocial { display:flex; gap:14px; }
.f-fsocial a { color:var(--fm); transition:color 0.3s; }
.f-fsocial a:hover { color:rgba(255,255,255,0.5); }

@media (max-width:768px) {
  .f-nav { padding:0 16px; height:58px; }
  .f-hero-inner { padding:100px 16px 60px; }
  .f-left h1 { font-size:1.8rem; }
  .f-left p { font-size:0.85rem; }
  .f-acts { flex-direction:column; align-items:center; }
  .f-sec { padding:55px 16px; }
  .f-center h2 { font-size:1.4rem; }
  .f-cta { padding:28px 18px; }
  .f-cta h2 { font-size:1.2rem; }
  .f-footer-inner { flex-direction:column; gap:6px; text-align:center; }
  .f-band-inner { gap:30px; }
  .f-band-item { gap:10px; }
  .f-band-num { font-size:1.2rem; }
  .f-stats { gap:24px; }
  .f-steps { gap:20px; }
}

.f-toast {
  position:fixed; bottom:24px; left:50%; transform:translateX(-50%); z-index:9999;
  background:rgba(237,66,69,0.14); backdrop-filter:blur(20px);
  border:1px solid rgba(237,66,69,0.14); border-radius:10px;
  padding:11px 22px; font-size:0.82rem; color:#f87171; direction:rtl;
}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <nav class="f-nav">
    <a href="/" class="f-brand">
      <div class="f-brand-badge"><i class="fas fa-bolt"></i></div>
      <span>FX9</span>
    </a>
    <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px">
      <% if (locals.user) { %>
        <a href="/home" class="f-nbtn f-nbtn-p"><i class="fas fa-th-large"></i> لوحة التحكم</a>
        <a href="/auth/logout" class="f-nbtn f-nbtn-d"><i class="fas fa-sign-out-alt"></i> خروج</a>
      <% } else { %>
        <a href="/auth/discord" class="f-nbtn f-nbtn-p"><i class="fab fa-discord"></i> Login with Discord</a>
      <% } %>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <% if (locals.error) { %>
    <div class="f-toast"><i class="fas fa-circle-exclamation"></i> <%= error %></div>
  <% } %>

  <section class="f-hero">
    <div class="f-hero-bg"></div>
    <div class="f-grid"></div>
    <div class="f-orb f-o1"></div>
    <div class="f-orb f-o2"></div>
    <div class="f-hero-inner">
      <div class="f-left">
        <div class="f-pill"><i class="fas fa-circle"></i> FADIX9 SYSTEM v1.0.11 — شغال</div>
        <h1>أداة متكاملة<br>لإدارة <em>السيرفر</em></h1>
        <p>لوحة تحكم شاملة تجمع الحماية، التذاكر، الغرف الصوتية، الإشراف، والإشعارات — كلها في واجهة واحدة بمزامنة فورية</p>
        <div class="f-acts">
          <% if (locals.user) { %>
            <a href="/home" class="f-btn f-btn-p"><i class="fas fa-th-large"></i> لوحة التحكم</a>
            <a href="/auth/logout" class="f-btn f-btn-s"><i class="fas fa-sign-out-alt"></i> خروج</a>
          <% } else { %>
            <a href="/auth/discord" class="f-btn f-btn-p"><i class="fab fa-discord"></i> سجل بدقيقة</a>
            <a href="/invite-dev" class="f-btn f-btn-s"><i class="fas fa-code-branch"></i> أضف البوت</a>
          <% } %>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="f-right">
        <div class="f-frame">
          <div class="f-frame-h">
            <div class="f-frame-dots">
              <div class="f-frame-dot"></div>
              <div class="f-frame-dot"></div>
              <div class="f-frame-dot"></div>
            </div>
            <span class="f-frame-title">FX9 Dashboard — نظرة عامة</span>
          </div>
          <div class="f-frame-b">
            <div class="f-frame-row">
              <div class="f-row-icon" style="background:rgba(99,102,241,0.08);color:var(--fp)"><i class="fas fa-shield-alt"></i></div>
              <div class="f-row-info">
                <div class="f-row-title">نظام الحماية</div>
                <div class="f-row-sub">12 هجوم تم حظره</div>
              </div>
              <span class="f-row-val">نشط</span>
            </div>
            <div class="f-frame-row">
              <div class="f-row-icon" style="background:rgba(139,92,246,0.08);color:var(--fp2)"><i class="fas fa-ticket-alt"></i></div>
              <div class="f-row-info">
                <div class="f-row-title">التذاكر</div>
                <div class="f-row-sub">3 تذاكر مفتوحة</div>
              </div>
              <span class="f-row-val">جديد</span>
            </div>
            <div class="f-frame-row">
              <div class="f-row-icon" style="background:rgba(52,211,153,0.08);color:#34d399"><i class="fas fa-microphone"></i></div>
              <div class="f-row-info">
                <div class="f-row-title">الغرف الصوتية</div>
                <div class="f-row-sub">5 غرف نشطة حالياً</div>
              </div>
              <span class="f-row-val">مباشر</span>
            </div>
            <div class="f-frame-row">
              <div class="f-row-icon" style="background:rgba(248,113,113,0.08);color:#f87171"><i class="fas fa-bell"></i></div>
              <div class="f-row-info">
                <div class="f-row-title">الإشعارات</div>
                <div class="f-row-sub">إشعار جديد من يوتيوب</div>
              </div>
              <span class="f-row-val">جديد</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="f-band">
    <div class="f-band-inner">
      <div class="f-band-item">
        <span class="f-band-num">6</span>
        <span class="f-band-lbl">أنظمة أمان</span>
      </div>
      <div class="f-band-item">
        <span class="f-band-num" id="heroCmdCount">—</span>
        <span class="f-band-lbl">أمر منفذ</span>
      </div>
      <div class="f-band-item">
        <span class="f-band-num">100%</span>
        <span class="f-band-lbl">وقت تشغيل</span>
      </div>
      <div class="f-band-item">
        <span class="f-band-num">24/7</span>
        <span class="f-band-lbl">دعم فني</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="f-sec">
    <div class="f-sec-inner">
      <div class="f-center">
        <div class="f-label f-label-p"><i class="fas fa-cubes"></i> المزايا</div>
        <h2>كل أدوات <em>الإدارة</em> في مكان</h2>
        <p>مجموعة أنظمة متكاملة صممت خصيصاً لتسهيل إدارة سيرفر ديسكورد بشكل احترافي</p>
      </div>
      <div class="f-cards">
        <div class="f-card">
          <div class="f-cicon" style="background:rgba(99,102,241,0.08);color:var(--fp)"><i class="fas fa-robot"></i></div>
          <h3>حماية تلقائية</h3>
          <p>كشف وحظر تلقائي للهجمات، السبام، والروابط الضارة مع إعدادات أمان ذكية وفلترة مخصصة</p>
        </div>
        <div class="f-card">
          <div class="f-cicon" style="background:rgba(139,92,246,0.08);color:var(--fp2)"><i class="fas fa-headset"></i></div>
          <h3>نظام دعم فني</h3>
          <p>تذاكر دعم بصلاحيات متعددة المستويات مع تقييم الأداء وإدارة متقدمة لفريق الدعم</p>
        </div>
        <div class="f-card">
          <div class="f-cicon" style="background:rgba(52,211,153,0.08);color:#34d399"><i class="fas fa-wave-square"></i></div>
          <h3>رومات ديناميكية</h3>
